{"q":"198","t":"House Robber","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>You are a professional robber planning to rob houses along a street. Each house has a certain amount of money stashed, the only constraint stopping you from robbing each of them is that adjacent houses have security systems connected and <b>it will automatically contact the police if two adjacent houses were broken into on the same night</b>.</p>\n\n<p>Given an integer array <code>nums</code> representing the amount of money of each house, return <em>the maximum amount of money you can rob tonight <b>without alerting the police</b></em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [1,2,3,1]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Rob house 1 (money = 1) and then rob house 3 (money = 3).\nTotal amount you can rob = 1 + 3 = 4.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [2,7,9,3,1]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 12\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Rob house 1 (money = 2), rob house 3 (money = 9) and rob house 5 (money = 1).\nTotal amount you can rob = 2 + 9 + 1 = 12.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 400</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"rob\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"}],"s":[{"t":"Maximum Product Subarray","s":"maximum-product-subarray","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"House Robber II","s":"house-robber-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Paint House","s":"paint-house","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Paint Fence","s":"paint-fence","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"House Robber III","s":"house-robber-iii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Non-negative Integers without Consecutive Ones","s":"non-negative-integers-without-consecutive-ones","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Coin Path","s":"coin-path","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Delete and Earn","s":"delete-and-earn","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Solving Questions With Brainpower","s":"solving-questions-with-brainpower","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Number of Ways to Place Houses","s":"count-number-of-ways-to-place-houses","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"House Robber IV","s":"house-robber-iv","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Mice and Cheese","s":"mice-and-cheese","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Largest Element in an Array after Merge Operations","s":"largest-element-in-an-array-after-merge-operations","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"House Robber V","s":"house-robber-v","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Meta","facebook"],["Infosys","infosys"],["tcs","tcs"],["Databricks","databricks"],["ByteDance","bytedance"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Expedia","expedia"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["Anduril","anduril"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Uber","uber"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Adobe","adobe"],["PayPal","paypal"],["Grab","grab"],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems"],["MakeMyTrip","makemytrip"],["Agoda","agoda"],["PhonePe","phonepe"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Airbnb","airbnb"]]}